      "id": "claim_053c9f042e5a495893e1281a385cdf85",
      "statement": "FakeChatModel stores scripted ChatResult replies (consumed FIFO via replies.pop(0)) and records every message list passed to invoke or structured in the public .calls attribute, making call-site assertions possible in unit tests.",
